    "body": "Yes the two tests seem to be asserting the same thing, with mine added a bit later and with some more failsafes to avoid a full 30 second test harness timeout in the event that a browser fails the test. I suppose we could remove Emilio's test since is a strict subset of mine? In any case, both of the tests are aligned with the spec test, so it seems that WebKit's implementation is just broken here.\r\n\r\nWith that said, @karlcow do you think we can close this bug?\r\n\r\n(Edit: Whoops, sorry for closing, that was premature!)",
